xarif build: go straight to single sign-on from the login page.

Why: on music.xarif.de every person signs in through Authelia, and the
password routes are refused at the reverse proxy (kubernetes/droppedneedle
resources/ingress.yaml). Upstream has no switch for that: the providers
answer always reports local login as available (server/auth/src/routes/
models.rs:205 "always true"). With OIDC configured the login page now starts
the OIDC flow on load; `/login?local` keeps the form for the break-glass admin
reached without the proxy (port-forward). Runs once per page load, so a
failed authorize shows its error instead of looping.

svelte-check 0 errors, prettier and eslint clean.

Remove when: upstream offers an SSO-only / auto-redirect setting.

